ry Claude Code session, /goal command to set completion conditions, /scroll-speed command, claude plugin details command, transcript view navigation improvements, hook args field for exec form spawning, MCP stdio servers now receive CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR. Fixed numerous bugs including deadlock with expired credentials, autoAllowBashIfSandboxed issues, and memory growth problems.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-11\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Background Agents in Slack\",\n    \"description\": \"You can now launch Background Agents directly from Slack by mentioning @Cursor. Agents can read the thread, understand context, and create PRs in GitHub without leaving the conversation. Includes search in settings, MCP progress notifications, dynamic tool registration, and roots support.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-09\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor 1.0 - BugBot, Background Agent GA, and MCP One-Click Install\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor 1.0 release featuring BugBot for automatic code review, Background Agent general availability for all users, Agent support for Jupyter Notebooks (Sonnet models), Memories beta for conversation context, MCP one-click install with OAuth support, richer chat responses with Mermaid diagrams and Markdown tables, new Dashboard with usage analytics.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-08\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Simplified Pricing and Max Mode for All Models\",\n    \"description\": \"Unified request-based pricing model, Max Mode now available for all state-of-the-art models with token-based pricing, new Tab model for multi-file suggestions, Background Agent preview with remote parallel execution, @folders support for entire codebase context, refreshed Inline Edit with full file edits and send-to-agent options, multi-root workspace support.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Rules Generation and Improved Agent Terminal\",\n    \"description\": \"Generate rules directly from conversations with /Generate Cursor Rules command, auto-attached rules with path patterns, chat history moved to command palette, built-in diff view for reviewing agent code, images support in MCP servers, improved agent terminal control with editable commands, global ignore files, new models (Gemini 2.5 Pro/Flash, Grok 3/Mini, GPT-4.1, o3/o4-mini), project structure in context beta.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-04\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Team-level Copilot Usage Metrics via API\",\n    \"description\": \"Team-level Copilot usage metrics now available via API, allowing enterprises to track and manage Copilot adoption across teams.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"GitHub Copilot App Technical Preview\",\n    \"description\": \"GitHub Copilot app is now available in technical preview, providing a new way to interact with Copilot features.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot Cloud Agent 